      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having a really bad headache right now. it's actually like the worst one i've ever had, it just hit me all of a sudden, like a clap of thunder or something. i feel a bit nauseous too but i think it's just because the pain is so intense. i get migraines all the time so i'm assuming it's just a really bad flare up... should i just take my sumatriptan now to try and knock it down?",
