      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk the sumatriptan usually works after like 20 mins but it's been a bit. its just so weird though, it felt so different coming on this time, like it just exploded in my head. but since I know I have migraines, it's probably just a bad one right? i don't really want to go to the ER if i don't have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. you think it's safe to just double up on the dose this one time to get ahead of the pain? maybe like 100mg instead of 50mg?",
