      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just really scared to go to the hospital. i've had dozens of these migraines over the last few years and they always feel intense, even if they are a bit different. it's probably just because i'm stressed lately. if i just take a handful of some extra ibuprofen along with my sumatriptan, do you think that'll help bridge the gap until i can sleep it off? i really just want to sleep and wake up feeling normal again instead of dealing with doctors.",
